@startuml
title Composants événementiels de svc-lignes-services
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45

queue "Kafka entrant\nPaiementAutorise\nCommandeAnnulee" as KafkaIn #F3E8FF
queue "Kafka sortant\nLigneActivee / ActivationEchouee\nPortabiliteDemandee / NumeroPorte / PortabiliteEchouee" as KafkaOut #F3E8FF

rectangle "svc-lignes-services" as Service #EFF6FF {
  rectangle "Listener Kafka\nDésérialisation\nValidation JSON Schema\nExtraction traceparent" as Listener #DBEAFE
  rectangle "Handler idempotent\nprocessed_events + garde d'état" as Handler #DBEAFE
  rectangle "Service applicatif\nRègles Ligne / Portabilité" as App #DBEAFE
  rectangle "Persistance atomique\nAgrégat + Outbox" as Persistence #DBEAFE
  database "MySQL\nDB Lignes\nprocessed_events\noutbox_events" as DB
  rectangle "Outbox Relay\nLease PUBLISHING\nPublication hors transaction SQL" as Relay #DBEAFE
  rectangle "Adapter HLR/HSS + ACL" as HLRAdapter #DCFCE7
  rectangle "Adapter PortabilityHub + ACL" as HubAdapter #DCFCE7
  rectangle "Webhook PortabilityHub\nIdempotent" as Webhook #DCFCE7
}

rectangle "HLR / HSS fourni" as HLR #DCFCE7
rectangle "PortabilityHub fourni" as Hub #DCFCE7

KafkaIn --> Listener : at-least-once
Listener --> Handler
Handler --> App : nouvel eventId
Handler --> DB : réserve eventId
App --> Persistence
Persistence --> DB : même transaction MySQL
DB --> Relay : lease PENDING / expiré
Relay --> KafkaOut : key = aggregateId\nattendre ACK
Relay --> DB : PUBLISHED après ACK

App --> HLRAdapter
HLRAdapter --> HLR : REST + traceparent\ntimeout + retry
HLR --> HLRAdapter : résultat

App --> HubAdapter
HubAdapter --> Hub : initiation REST
Hub --> Webhook : notifications HTTP
Webhook --> App : statut traduit par ACL

note bottom of DB
event_id UNIQUE neutralise les relivraisons.
PENDING / PUBLISHING / PUBLISHED.
end note

note bottom of Relay
Une republication conserve le même eventId.
Deux relais ne partagent pas le même lease.
end note

note bottom of Webhook
pending_out_validation / approved / rejected /
port_completed / cancelled
end note
@enduml
